    "8 oz unsalted butter (room temperature)",
    "12 oz confectioner's sugar (3 cups)",
    "8 oz cream cheese (room temperature)",
    "⅛ teaspoon table salt",
    "1 teaspoon lemon juice",
    "1 tablespoon vanilla extract"
